### Set token to LIFEOPS_BACKEND_TOKEN from fastapi-backend/.env (omit the header if it is empty)
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8010
@token = paste-the-token-here

### Create a LifeOps plan
POST {{base}}/api/plan
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "user_input": "I have exams next week, 2 assignments, and a meeting tomorrow",
  "autonomous_mode": false,
  "timezone": "Europe/Zurich"
}

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List actions
GET {{base}}/api/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Execute all safe actions
POST {{base}}/api/actions/execute-safe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
